title: SAP ASE (Sybase): Database Log Usage
agents: linux
catalog: app/sybase
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the used space of the dedicated log segment of an SAP
 ASE (Sybase) database, reported by the agent plug-in {check_sybase}.

 Levels for the used space in percent (default: 80% WARN, 90% CRIT) and
 optionally for the absolute free space can be configured via the rule
 "SAP ASE (Sybase) Database Log Usage", per host and per database.

item:
 The SID of the ASE instance and the database name, separated by a space.

discovery:
 One service is created for each database with a dedicated log segment.
